OL,3,GNEWSASailings cancelled over heavy
OL,4,Arain, 16 more at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome ferry sailings have been cancelled
OL,7,Fahead of Friday's planned journeys
OL,8,Fwhile 16 others remain at risk from
OL,9,Ftomorrow until Sunday.
OL,11,FForecasters at Ronaldsway Met Office
OL,12,Fhave issued a yellow warning for heavy
OL,13,Frain from 03:00 BST on Friday until
OL,14,F15:00.
OL,16,FRain will become "persistent and heavy
OL,17,Ftonight", before gradually easing and
OL,18,Fpetering out later tomorrow morning and
OL,19,Fearly afternoon, forecasters said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
