OL,3,GNEWSASailings cancelled over heavy
OL,4,Arain, 16 more at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result of the weather warning, the
OL,7,FSteam Packet Company announced the
OL,8,FManannan sailing to Larne at 06:45 as
OL,9,Fwell as the return crossing scheduled
OL,10,Ffor 10:45 had been cancelled.
